# A statement about the triple term "Alice is named Alice" (RDF 1.2 Turtle
# §2.8): the term a decoded result hands the rendering tests to place in a
# pattern.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .

ex:aliceNaming rdf:reifies <<( ex:alice foaf:name "Alice" )>> .
